cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its datasets, please cite the paper in `preferred-citation`."
title: "g-mm-repair: A Memory-Bounded GPU Engine for Right Multiplication over Grammar-Compressed Matrices"
abstract: >-
  A high-performance level-synchronous GPU engine (CUDA C++) for computing the right
  matrix-vector product y = Mx over RePair grammar-compressed matrices, with an
  emit-on-the-spot memory optimization and Boolean/Tropical semiring support, applied to
  genotype matrices and knowledge-graph relations.
